  specs/example/tickets/one.md,"# One\n\nBlocked by: none\nWrites: specs\nCovers: PF1, PF2\n\n## What to build\n\nBuild it.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [ ] It is built.\n"
  specs/example/spec.md,"# example\n\nStatus: staged\n\n## User stories\n1. As a, I want b, so c.\n\n### Acceptance coverage map\n| row | story | behavior | seam | why it catches the failure |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| PF1 | 1 | does x | cli seam | catches z |\n| PF2 | 1 | does y | cli seam | catches w |\n\n## Ownership fences\n\n- `internal/example/` (implementation)\n- `reviews/example.md` (review pickup)\n- `.agents/skills/bench-craft-delegate/` (delegation instructions)\n- `.agents/commands/bench-implement-spec.md` (build instructions)\n\n## Completion plan\n\n```bench-completion-plan\n{\"version\":1,\"chunks\":[{\"id\":\"c1\",\"tickets\":[\"one.md\"],\"verification\":[{\"id\":\"tests\",\"command\":\"go test ./...\"}]}],\"final_verification\":[{\"id\":\"acceptance\",\"command\":\"go test ./...\"}]}\n```\n"
